R3 is **not ready to freeze**. It restores the study’s families and closes several earlier defects, but the presentation-fragment contract, version selection, BPMN evidence and G0 handoff remain incomplete.

Review was read-only. The supplied SHA-256 matches both the snapshot and commit `f6f3ba37`; the delta reconstructs r3 exactly. Node reproduced all four G0 vectors—186/206/86/320 bytes—and the expected digest-mutation behavior. The checked source hashes and all 198 vendored d2d files match their pins.

